      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "goal-class",
          "nodeId": "goal"
        },
        "markdown": "Goal is a strategic or local outcome. It is static-first, fragment-safe, and intended to parent tasks, decisions, and constraints.\n\nAuthored fields: `label`, `body`, `priority`, `status`, `owner`, `targetDate`, `successMetrics`.\n\nThe detail surface represents the full editor contract; card and icon surfaces are deliberate projections.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "Goal is a strategic or local outcome. It is static-first, fragment-safe, and intended to parent tasks, decisions, and constraints.\n\nAuthored fields: `label`, `body`, `priority`, `status`, `owner`, `targetDate`, `successMetrics`.\n\nThe detail surface represents the full editor contract; card and icon surfaces are deliberate projections."
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
